 "self_load_only": true,
 "description": "BIGVILLE R15 (block 263000) -- THE 247 EVIDENCE-AND-PROOF PIPELINE (NOT omniscience). The constable learns of an act by WITNESS (bv_witness_evidence, line-of-sight) OR REPORT (bv_report_evidence, a testimony Message -- the load-bearing report channel); bv_physical logs the victim's real health-drop as PHYSICAL evidence (the corroboration a false report lacks). bv_form_belief is the ABDUCTION: observed = Sum of evidence weights, verdict = Argmax over the constable's held CaseGenerator codebook by fit -|predicts-observed| (a RECONSTRUCTION, not a fact -- the manifold-of-projections move). bv_sufficient_proof requires a GUILTY verdict with confidence >= proof_threshold (the decision_value); insufficient/contradicted evidence DECLINES for the RIGHT reason (unseen-abuse / false-accusation floor). ZERO new Rust.",
